{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Module 04 — Verification Portal Architecture\nStreamlit front end · `module_04_ui/src/app.py` (573 lines) · service `ui-engine` (python:3.11-slim) · 2026-07-29 (main-demo @ 5c65046)",
      "x": 360,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "browser",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**User / Browser**\nOnly external entry point",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "ui-service",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`ui-engine` container**\nStreamlit app on host port **8501**\nThe *only* docker-compose service exposed on a host port — the three engines are internal services",
      "x": 420,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Page: Dashboard**\nOverview, engine cards, quick-launch radio",
      "x": 880,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "page-spec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Page: Spec Engine**\nOne page per engine (1 of 3)\n`POST spec-engine:8000/verify` (BPMN XML)",
      "x": 880,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "page-extract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Page: Extract Engine**\nOne page per engine (2 of 3)\n`POST extract-engine:8000/verify` (Python source)",
      "x": 880,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "page-equiv",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Page: Equiv Engine**\nOne page per engine (3 of 3)\nCalls its engine over HTTP like the others — `POST equiv-engine:8000/lift` demo (fixed in PR #74)",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-engine",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Spec Engine** (Module 01)\nInternal docker-compose service",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "extract-engine",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Extract Engine** (Module 02)\nInternal docker-compose service",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "equiv-call",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Equiv Engine** (Module 03)\nInternal docker-compose service\nReal FastAPI service since PR #74: `POST /lift`, `POST /check`, `GET /health` (uvicorn :8000)",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "health-http",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Sidebar status dots: all three engines**\nReal HTTP health checks — `GET /docs` (Spec, Extract), `GET /health` (Equiv), 2s timeout. Dots reflect actual engine reachability — the old asymmetry is gone",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-equiv",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Gap: `POST /check` has no UI demo**\nFull Phase A–D conformance check needs a call-order-lifted WIR, which extract-engine's own HTTP API doesn't produce yet — the equiv page documents this itself",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "cert-caveat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Gap: zero tests**\nNo test suite exists for Module 04 — the whole module is one 573-line `app.py`, a 12-line Dockerfile, and a 2-line requirements.txt",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "novelty-caveat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Scope disclaimer**\nStill explicitly disclaims research novelty: *'a UI/integration layer, not a research contribution in itself'*",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
